## 二、新构造

### HIGH：`||` 被当成纯结构删除

输入字节：

```text
7c7c0a
```

复现命令：

```sh
python3 -B /Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-v6-inbox/canvas-vault/.claude/skills/clear-inbox/scripts/inbox_preview.py \
